# Implementation Plan - InsightAI: AI-Powered Business Intelligence Platform

InsightAI is an end-to-end AI-powered Business Intelligence platform that empowers businesses to upload tabular datasets (Excel, CSV, JSON), auto-clean data, generate interactive rich visual dashboards, run predictive forecasts, detect anomalies, generate natural language insights, and chat with their data using RAG.

