## Key Features & Component Breakdown

### 1. Frontend (React + Tailwind CSS + Recharts + Framer Motion)
- **Design Aesthetic**: Premium glassmorphism UI with vibrant dark mode default, custom color tokens, responsive sidebar layout, smooth transitions.
- **Pages**:
  - **Login & Register**: JWT Authentication form with toggleable demo mode.
  - **Dashboard Overview**: KPI metric cards (Total Revenue, Profit, Total Sales, Top Category, Top City) with delta indicators, monthly revenue trend chart, recent activity feed.
  - **Upload Dataset**: Interactive drag-and-drop zone supporting `.xlsx`, `.xls`, `.csv`, `.json` with real-time cleaning preview & column-type auto-detection.
  - **Dataset Details / Data Cleaner**: TanStack Table grid showing raw vs. cleaned data, missing value suggestions, outliers, and schema customization.
  - **Analytics Hub**: Dynamic chart builder with Bar, Line, Area, Pie, Heatmap, Scatter, Box Plot, and Histogram views, interactive filtering by category/date range.
  - **Predictive Forecast**: Time-series forecasting tab displaying historical data alongside predicted future revenue/sales with upper/lower confidence bounds.
  - **Anomaly Alert Center**: Isolation Forest results listing flagged transaction anomalies in red with severity scores and anomaly explanations.
  - **Chat with Your Data (RAG)**: Conversational chat interface allowing natural language questions (e.g. *"Which city had the highest sales?"*, *"Show January sales"*), returning structured answers and instant chart responses.
  - **Reports & Export**: One-click PDF generation, Excel summary export, and PowerPoint export template.

### 2. Backend (Node.js + Express + Prisma)
- **Auth**: JWT signup, login, profile, password hash with `bcryptjs`.
- **File Upload Handler**: `multer` disk storage with MIME validation.
- **Service Orchestration**: Passes uploaded files to the Python FastAPI microservice for processing and stores structured results in PostgreSQL / SQLite.
- **Real-Time Signals**: Socket.io server to broadcast live updates when datasets finish processing or when multi-user changes occur.

### 3. Python AI Microservice (FastAPI + Pandas + Scikit-Learn + Prophet/Statsmodels)
- **Auto Data Cleaning**: Identifies NaNs, converts dates, strips whitespace, standardizes currency strings, identifies outliers using Z-score / IQR.
- **Statistics & Chart Generator**: Computes summary statistics, correlation matrices, categorical distributions, and time-series groupings.
- **Insights Engine**: Rule-based + LLM generation of executive summaries, growth drivers, drop alerts, and recommendations.
- **Forecasting Module**: Fits time-series model on historical date/metric columns and projects future performance (30/60/90 days).
- **Anomaly Detection Module**: Trains Isolation Forest classifier on numeric metrics (Revenue, Price, Quantity) to detect anomalous transactions.
- **RAG & Tabular Q&A**: Hybrid query engine (Pandas SQL query synthesizer + vector/semantic similarity) to answer complex questions strictly from dataset context.

